        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "N. The Board agrees to provide substitute teachers for art, music, and P.E. teachers and media specialists. No full-time teacher shall be used as a substitute for another teacher except in cases of emergency or unforeseen circumstances. The parties agree to review the substitute teacher availability problem. A joint committee shall be established by September 30, 1987, and a report of recommendation shall be completed by November 1, 1987.",
